    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Quantum is a very common space mineral that was discovered in the MEGA universe, where they use this mineral as fuel for spaceships. Something is happening with the Quantum mines that are beginning to disappear, you have been recruited like many other explorers to solve this mystery.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216190/extras/d67422d59b6ad6a6ad9baef85d1921b9.webp?t=1740353160\" /></div><br><br>Stel is a space action-adventure game with procedurally generated elements. Explore the different planets finding increasingly deadly enemies, find and buy items to upgrade your ship and solve the mystery of the universe, Quantum mines are disappearing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 playable ships<br></li><li>More than 20 totally different enemies<br></li><li>Over 50 combinable items<br></li><li>Integrated control support for controllers<br></li><li>Multiple save files<br></li><li>Lots of achievements</li></ul><br><br>For more details on the game follow us on twitter @mekmekdev or enter to Discord server<br><br>Music produced by Pablo Gillet, Instagram: @wavpablo",
